      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The relentless spin of the world is a constant pressure, and feeling like you're falling behind is a deeply painful realization. The idea of fading away when you're no longer \"needed\" is a very lonely thought, but your worth isn't tied to your utility to the world. If the world itself feels too loud, perhaps finding a very small, quiet corner—even just for a few minutes—is the only place you can anchor yourself right now.",
